{"path":"regex/sub_match/str","title":"std::sub_match<BidirIt>::operator string_type, std::sub_match<BidirIt>::str","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::sub_match&lt;BidirIt&gt;::</span>operator string_type, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::sub_match&lt;BidirIt&gt;::</span>str","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/sub_match/str","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"Converts to an object of the underlying std::basic_string type.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator string_type<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">string_type str<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Converts to an object of the underlying <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\">std::basic_string</a></span> type.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> An implicit conversion.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> An explicit conversion.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The matched character sequence as an object of the underlying <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\">std::basic_string</a></span> type. If the <code>matched</code> member is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>, then returns the empty string.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in the length of the underlying character sequence.\n</p